[engl]
{100}{}{Aradesh}
{200}{}{You see Aradesh.}
{1000}{}{Predialogue installations}
{1010}{}{Tandi begin}
{1020}{}{Tandi ongoing}
{1030}{}{Found the raiders hideout}
{1040}{}{Tandi rescue completed }
{2000}{}{Thank goodness you came! I am in desperate need of assistance. My daughter, Tandi, is missing. I do not know what to do!}
{2010}{}{Have you tried to save her?}
{2020}{}{Uhh?}
{3000}{}{My people are not skilled in this. Already three patrols have gone out to look, but none returned. Will you help me?}
{3010}{}{Okay. Who could have taken her?}
{3020}{}{ I am sorry, but I have other things I have to do.}
{4000}{}{Seth and I believe one of the raider clans is responsible - retribution for our resistance to them. Take this spear. It was found where my daughter was last seen.}
{4010}{}{Okay, I'll check it out.}
{5000}{}{Please, talk to Seth. He knows much about these raiders. And God speed, wanderer.}
{5010}{}{See ya later.}
{6000}{}{Ahh, wanderer. How goes the search for my daughter?}
{6010}{}{Sorry, but I haven't found her. I will, though.}
{6020}{}{I'm sorry, but she is dead.}
{6030}{}{Duh-nada.}
{7000}{}{Thank you for trying. Please leave me to my grief.}
{8000}{}{May my thoughts be wings to your feet. Please hurry.}
{9000}{}{Since you brought my Tandi back to me, things are quite fine. My eternal gratitude to you, wanderer.}

